    "method": "All 62 registered graphs validated and deterministically baked by preview-materials; focused material library, matgraph and validation regression files pass33 tests, including actual cutout alpha, metadata, invalid cutoffs, physical hole width and jointless bronze. Round perforation addition: all63graphs schema/bake and registration checks plus round4mm aperture/12mm pitch pass5material-library tests; existing62graph bytes unchanged. High-open circular screen addition:64 graphs registered;9mm round apertures/12mm pitch yield approximately44% alpha-cutout open area; five focused material tests pass and63 prior graph hashes are unchanged. Expanded diamond addition:65 registered graphs validated/baked;5material tests pass including56% aperture coverage and staggered diagonal bonds. All64 prior graph hashes remain unchanged."
  },
